If you send a pull request, you confirm that you have the right to submit it. You also grant Dan Dingle a perpetual,
worldwide, royalty-free, irrevocable licence to use, change and distribute your contribution as part of DINGLECRAFT.

## 7. AI players

The optional AI players use your own Anthropic API key, and you pay for that API usage yourself. Never commit your key.

## 8. No warranty

DINGLECRAFT is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. Dan Dingle is not liable for any damage arising from its
use. That includes the AI players spending your API credits and Malgorath eating your world.

## 9. Ending this licence

If you break these terms, your permission to use DINGLECRAFT ends automatically.

